  "bio": "Discover your next masterpiece at Art Collective Augusta, where premier tattoos in neotraditional, trash polka, and black & gray styles come to life. Nestled in the vibrant heart of Augusta on 3010 Washington Rd, this studio welcomes both appointments and walk-ins, offering an immersive experience in art and self-expression. Check out their \"TOUR\" dates to catch them on the move or swing by their Grovetown location at 721 Gateway Center Blvd for an unforgettable ink journey!\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Augusta, Georgia, United States"
